# Allowlist, not a denylist.
#
# Two reasons it is inverted. First, `.env` sits at the repo root and holds MODEL_API_KEY; a
# denylist that forgets one line pushes a credential into a public registry layer. Second, the
# build context is otherwise ~470 MB (.venv 422 M, units/ 44 M) and every byte of it is pull time
# charged against the unit clock.
#
# The image needs exactly two files. Add a line here only when the Dockerfile grows a COPY.
*
!forecast_agent.py
!text_signal.py
